{"abstract":[{"text":"Controls how strictly a test store checks pending events when observation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"finishes.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TestExhaustivity","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"InnoRouter’s test stores follow TCA’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TestStore"},{"text":" exhaustivity model:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"events collected from the underlying authority’s unified ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onEvent"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"callback accumulate in an internal queue. Each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"receive(...)"},{"text":" call dequeues the next event and asserts a predicate. In","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".strict"},{"text":" mode, the store reports events left pending at ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finish()"},{"text":" or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deallocation.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"assertNoPendingEvents()"},{"text":" is a non-terminal checkpoint: it reports and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consumes the current pending snapshot, then continues observing. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finish()"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"closes the queue, consumes its final snapshot, and reports the first event","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"emitted after that boundary in both exhaustivity modes.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","name":"Note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Testing currently attributes issues recorded inside an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"isolated "},{"code":"deinit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to an "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"unknown test"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" rather than to the test that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"owned the store, which makes a deinit-time leftover-event failure"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hard to locate. Until that is resolved upstream, await all work and end"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each test with an explicit "},{"code":"finish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". It runs the strict check with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"caller’s source location and disarms the deinit-time fallback."}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/innoroutertesting\/testexhaustivity"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"InnoRouterTesting"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","externalID":"s:17InnoRouterTesting16TestExhaustivityO","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TestExhaustivity","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"TestExhaustivity","symbolKind":"enum","remoteSource":{"fileName":"TestExhaustivity.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/InnoSquadCorp\/InnoRouter\/blob\/5.1.0\/Sources\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity.swift#L25"},"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TestExhaustivity","kind":"identifier"}]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.core\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Enumeration Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.core\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity\/off",